{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave the game on and watch Lyse work in a post-apocalyptic world on the corner of your desktop. Her job is to collect microbe samples; your job is to lend a hand when you can.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What you can do:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbClick on microbes to help collect them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUpdate laboratory equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbInteract with Lyse by clicking on her</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/0bb762e0aad7fa90ad5fa25ddcc33231.poster.avif?t=1763552190\" width=712 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/0bb762e0aad7fa90ad5fa25ddcc33231.webm?t=1763552190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/0bb762e0aad7fa90ad5fa25ddcc33231.mp4?t=1763552190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the game:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn idle game you can leave on the corner of your screen and play whenever you like</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMore variety of microbes will gather as research levels increase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbSalvage junk to sell so you can upgrade equipment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbUpgrade equipment to automate them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbLyse may be hiding a secret\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/a7226e15dc1cb36606bc98776de13280.avif?t=1763552190\" width=720 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lastly:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThis game doesn\u2019t have an objective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbResearch levels are there just as an indicator, but there is no \u201cEnding\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbThere is only one little event that occurs after you\u2019ve collected all microbes there are to collect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEnjoy the game at your leisure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbHave fun in the post-apocalyptic world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/86603102b2a39b94282f0c3863df8151.poster.avif?t=1763552190\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/86603102b2a39b94282f0c3863df8151.webm?t=1763552190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/extras/86603102b2a39b94282f0c3863df8151.mp4?t=1763552190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3780030?t=1763552190","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/b80a1e5b7cc79e545661f021fda69827d471ae2c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763552190","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/5e70124909ce3085117f76d303eeaf21049e9aba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763552190","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3780030/5e70124909ce3085117f76d303eeaf21049e9aba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763552190","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\